Solutions to all three questions of the <University of Oxford> Part A <quantum theory> paper, sat on 16 June 2021. Source: https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/bsc_mathematics_part_a_examinati/response/2820674/attach/3/FOI%20202410%20944%20Data.pdf#page=145[original released PDF, bundle pages 145–148; paper pages 1–4]. The symbol $\hbar$ denotes the <reduced Planck constant>. All four measurement experiments in question 1(c) start independently from the <wavefunction> in question 1(b).

